From 629df0d091a498ada8e34fdbca4acd360417411a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:29:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Lower coherent color fetches to shader tile images

Use typed TileImageEXT declarations and OpColorAttachmentReadEXT for single-sample directly represented float and unsigned color inputs when existing ordered paths are unavailable. Carry fixed attachment locations without descriptors and require real Vulkan 1.3 dynamic rendering and shaderTileImageColorReadAccess enables. Bound helper-value dataflow conservatively and refuse unsupported sample, converted-format, and raster-order-group forms.

Validate authored AIR-to-pipeline output, cache metadata, feature gates, derivative refusal, and existing ROAA/interlock forms with the focused tile_image integration target and spirv-val. Keep structural builder/dataflow unit coverage in source; the full lib-test target exceeds this workspace memory during compilation.
